MarketRemoveCollateralTest
├── given assets is max uint256
│   ├── when initiator has zero collateral assets
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when initiator has collateral assets
│       └── it should remove collateral with initiator assets
└── given assets is not max uint256
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when assets is greater than zero
        └── it should remove collateral with specified assets 